OL,3,GNEWSA'I love how vile Madame Morrible
OL,4,Ais' - Wicked star
OL,5,
OL,6,FAs the West End show Wicked marks its
OL,7,F20th anniversary, one of the cast's
OL,8,Fnewest members said she is having great
OL,9,Ffun playing one of its main characters.
OL,11,FClaire Machin, originally from
OL,12,FStoke-on-Trent, is taking on Madame
OL,13,FMorrible as a series of special pink,
OL,14,Fgreen and gala performances are
OL,15,Fscheduled at the Apollo Victoria
OL,16,FTheatre in London.
OL,18,F"I love how vile she is," she said of
OL,19,Fher character. "It's great fun to
OL,20,Fplay."
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
